BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Before the Blue Jays: Professional Baseball in Toronto Prior to 19
 77
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T113000
UID:6a7e2ad9386764026a16e0c0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Harvey Sahker presents his book\, "\nBefore the Blue Jays\n" (
 Dundurn\, 2026).​ Discover the fascinating history of professional baseb
 all in Toronto before 1977\, when the Blue Jays first took flight. Learn a
 bout the major events\, venues\, and people who trail-blazed the way to th
 e arrival of Major League Baseball in Toronto.
LOCATION:Jane/Sheppard\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7e2ad9386764026a16e0c0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
