BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How to Identify and Prevent Fraud and Scams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T150000
UID:6a8714ebd4b10d003007ca52@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Fraud and scams are becoming more common.\nPresented by financ
 ial empowerment staff from North York Community House\, this interactive w
 orkshop will help participants learn how to:\nspot and avoid common scams
 \nprotect your personal and financial information\nwhat to do if someone t
 ries to scam you\nand where to get help if you or someone you know has bee
 n victim of fraud.\nDrop-in welcome!\nNo registration required.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8714ebd4b10d003007ca52
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
